{
 "id": 1803936,
 "titulo": "12/27 Patch Details (Completed)",
 "fecha": 1703656813637,
 "modificada": 1752168534735,
 "url": "https://forum.netmarble.com/futurefight_en/view/2196/1803936",
 "html": "<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><img alt=\"\" id=\"1700532932049\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/a3dcbba583c045b8a5a5dbe0912fe81e_1700532932049_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Greetings, Agents.&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">This is CM Fragment of MARVEL Future Fight.</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">As Winter approaches, a Specialist of absorption abilities,&nbsp;<br>\nand the Elite Agent of S.H.I.E.L.D. have secretly begun their missions!</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#8e44ad;\">Rogue</span>, who can use various abilities through absorption,&nbsp;<br>\nhas become stronger with a new Uniform and Tier-4 Advancement.&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#8e44ad;\">Phil Coulson</span>, with his new Uniform and Tier-3 Advancement,<br>\nwill prove himself as a leader by overcoming various challenges&nbsp;<br>\ninside and outside the organization.</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Agents, check out the new skills and power of the updated heroes<br>\nby downloading the 12/27 Patch!</span></span><br>\n&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#8e44ad;\"><strong>■ 12/27 Patch Details</strong></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Patch Schedule: 12/28 (Thu) 3:00&nbsp;(UTC+0), 12/27 (Wed) 19:00&nbsp;(PST)</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#ff0099;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">[12/28&nbsp;(Thu) 3:06 (UTC+0), 12/27&nbsp;(Wed) 19:06 (PST) added]</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">The patch has been completed as of&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">12/28 (Thu)&nbsp;3:04 (UTC+0), 12/27 (Wed) 19:04&nbsp;(PST).</span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Please reconnect to the game and download the patch file.</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#ff0099;\">* The patch completion time may be changed depending on the circumstances&nbsp;<br>\nand the </span><span style=\"color:#8e44ad;\">completion time will be announced once the patch has been completed</span><span style=\"color:#ff0099;\">.<br>\n* The patch will be applied in waves, so the application time may vary by Agent.<br>\n* The game can still be accessed during the patch.<br>\nWhen the patch is complete, please restart and apply the patch for better service.</span></span></span><br>\n&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><br>\n<span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#e67e22;\"><strong>▣ Two New Uniforms</strong></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Two new Uniforms Rogue &lt;Winter Ops&gt; and Phil Coulson &lt;Winter Ops&gt; have been added.&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#ff0099;\">* The two new Uniforms can be purchased after the 12/27 Patch data has been applied.<br>\n* The new Uniforms can be purchased during the event period.</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#8e44ad;\">▶ Rogue &lt;Winter Ops&gt;:&nbsp;<br>\nAfter the 2023/12/27 Patch - 2024/1/12 (Fri) 14:59 (UTC+0),&nbsp;<br>\nAfter the 2023/12/27 Patch - 2024/1/12 (Fri) 6:59 (PST)</span><br>\n<span style=\"color:#2980b9;\">- Purchase method: Can be exchanged at the Event Shop with 2023 Holiday Tokens<br>\n- 2023 Holiday Tokens can be acquired by purchasing event products or more until&nbsp;<br>\n1/9 (Tue) 14:59 (UTC+0), 1/9 (Tue) 6:59 (PST).</span><br>\n<span style=\"color:#8e44ad;\">▶ Phil Coulson &lt;Winter Ops&gt;:&nbsp;<br>\nAfter the 2023/12/27 Patch - 2024/1/9 (Tue) 14:59 (UTC+0),&nbsp;<br>\nAfter the 2023/12/27 Patch - 2024/1/9 (Tue) 6:59 (PST)</span><br>\n<span style=\"color:#2980b9;\">- Purchase method: Crystal purchase (Discount events will not be applied.)</span><br>\n<span style=\"color:#ff0099;\">* Season Uniforms may be available again after&nbsp;<br>\nthe event has ended through similar events or packages.<br>\n* New Uniform Skills are based on the following skill Level stats.&nbsp;<br>\n(Tier-4 heroes: Lv. 10, Others: Lv. 6)&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><img alt=\"\" id=\"1703641683291\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/f7f8010d60b24014a7a21a93cb27a327_1703641683291_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" id=\"1703645300613\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/9245744c918a47988a107dd35d8de1c1_1703645300613_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#e67e22;\"><strong>▣ Rogue Tier-4</strong></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Rogue is now available for Tier-4 Advancement.&nbsp;<br>\nNow no one can stop Rogue who has gained even stronger absorbing abilities.</span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#ff0099;\">* The skill effects are based on Lv.6 stats.</span>&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><img alt=\"\" id=\"1703641746045\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/5ef5fcc7f23e47bba690f76d13621810_1703641746045_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#e67e22;\"><strong>▣ Phil Coulson Tier-3</strong></span>&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Phil Coulson is now available for Tier-3 Advancement.&nbsp;<br>\nCheck out the new looks of Phil Coulson,&nbsp;<br>\nwho protects the world from darkness as the leader of S.H.I.E.L.D.</span></span><br>\n&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><img alt=\"\" id=\"1703641777500\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/b265971e46eb463cad49746d2fdc2b24_1703641777500_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><img alt=\"\" id=\"1703641801685\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/b563370daf894650b94a7649fe7ccb41_1703641801685.gif\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#e67e22;\"><strong>▣ New Artifact</strong></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">New Artifacts of Phil Coulson and Rogue have been added.&nbsp;<br>\n<span style=\"color:#ff0099;\">* The effects are based on the 6★ Artifact passive skill Lv.4 stats.</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><img alt=\"\" id=\"1703641818524\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/113ef210ec13460fbde6ae34d0f118b2_1703641818524_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">We look forward to your active participation in the events&nbsp;<br>\nthat will be held to support the growth of the updated heroes.</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Thank you.</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><img alt=\"\" id=\"1703641832868\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/29009d0ced6e4cfa8dc3cec41cdfdf80_1703641832868_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></span></span></p>\n"
}